The contact solve balanced 500 N, but its 0.959 mm maximum displacement also exceeded the initial estimate, so I have not accepted its stress result. The simple estimate omitted bending of the thin material above the bore; I’m checking that effect and the pad load before deciding whether the contact result is usable.
